  "notes": "USAGE:\nOften used in publishing, education, and presentations. {図解|ずかい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ means to illustrate or explain with diagrams. Very common in book titles, especially for introductory or reference works.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {図解|ずかい}つき (with illustrations; illustrated)\n- {図解|ずかい}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{説明|せつめい}する→説明する：05639_setsumeisuru⟧ (to explain with diagrams)\n- {図解|ずかい}⟦{入門|にゅうもん}→入門：11643_nyuumon⟧ (illustrated introduction — common book title format)\n- {図解|ずかい}⟦{事典|じてん}→事典：21891_jiten⟧ (illustrated encyclopedia)",
